WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.393
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.663 --> 00:04.871
But I don't love you.

3
00:05.746 --> 00:07.663
I don't believe you.

4
00:07.663 --> 00:08.983
I don't...

5
00:42.871 --> 00:45.455
Do you really feel nothing?

6
00:45.455 --> 00:46.871
But your body is telling me

7
00:46.871 --> 00:49.027
that we feel the same way.

8
00:50.330 --> 00:51.746
Lie.

9
00:51.746 --> 00:53.996
You've always been like this.

10
00:53.996 --> 00:57.038
You just do whatever you want.

11
00:57.038 --> 00:59.455
I'll tell you one more time.

12
00:59.455 --> 01:01.318
I don't love you.

13
01:02.330 --> 01:03.496
Lin Zai.

14
01:03.496 --> 01:05.663
Don't be like this.

15
01:07.371 --> 01:08.996
Then tell me.

16
01:08.996 --> 01:10.288
What exactly should I do

17
01:10.288 --> 01:12.599
so we can go back to how we were?

18
01:21.080 --> 01:23.661
Do you know what I need most?

19
01:24.830 --> 01:28.163
I need a peaceful and stable life,

20
01:28.163 --> 01:31.080
not to live in fear every day.

21
01:32.538 --> 01:36.955
I need someone who can understand my fear

22
01:36.955 --> 01:39.500
and my weakness.

23
01:39.500 --> 01:42.250
Can you give me that?

24
01:43.746 --> 01:45.812
You can't even understand it, can you?

25
01:46.833 --> 01:49.034
But I can learn.

26
01:53.996 --> 01:55.663
But you've never even thought about

27
01:55.663 --> 02:00.175
giving up your mission for me, have you?

28
02:11.163 --> 02:13.496
Where are you going now?

29
02:13.496 --> 02:16.371
Are you going to see He Yao again?

30
02:16.371 --> 02:19.955
Even at a time like this, you're still saying things like that.

31
02:19.955 --> 02:23.205
This just proves that you don't understand me at all.

32
04:23.846 --> 04:28.394
[Apocalypse Log 18]

33
04:37.663 --> 04:40.250
Is the water temperature okay?

34
04:40.250 --> 04:42.542
The water temperature is just right.

35
04:45.417 --> 04:47.288
He Yao.

36
04:47.288 --> 04:49.417
You're here, too.

37
04:49.417 --> 04:51.167
I'm here to try some herbs for Grandma Qiu.

38
04:51.167 --> 04:53.708
And to give Chen Jin some electrolytes.

39
04:53.708 --> 04:55.525
Dr. He is so thoughtful.

40
04:55.525 --> 04:57.554
He's always thinking about my needs.

41
04:57.554 --> 04:59.708
Thank you so much.

42
04:59.708 --> 05:03.898
Dr. He is being so helpful to us.

43
05:04.861 --> 05:08.623
I don't know how to thank you.

44
05:08.623 --> 05:10.623
Don't mention it, Grandma Qiu.

45
05:10.623 --> 05:11.862
Lin Zai is my junior.

46
05:11.862 --> 05:14.657
It's only right that I take care of you.

47
05:14.657 --> 05:16.382
Junior?

48
05:16.382 --> 05:18.202
Yes, we're alumni.

49
05:18.202 --> 05:21.165
It must be fate.

50
05:21.165 --> 05:23.623
I heard you were in the same camp before.

51
05:23.623 --> 05:24.680
Yes.

52
05:24.680 --> 05:27.950
Lin Zai is a real...

53
06:26.917 --> 06:28.424
Come in.

54
06:31.292 --> 06:32.583
Lin Zai.

55
06:32.583 --> 06:34.000
Why are you here at this hour?

56
06:34.000 --> 06:35.483
Is something wrong?

57
06:37.375 --> 06:39.373
I want to see my brother.

58
06:39.373 --> 06:42.373
How is he now?

59
06:42.373 --> 06:43.748
Still the same.

60
06:43.748 --> 06:45.290
During the observation period,

61
06:45.290 --> 06:47.954
his vitals haven't fluctuated abnormally.

62
06:49.355 --> 06:51.723
Lin Zai, I know you're anxious,

63
06:51.723 --> 06:55.248
but research requires a focused and undisturbed environment.

64
06:55.248 --> 06:57.331
In the future, unless I call for you,

65
06:57.331 --> 06:58.623
try to come here less often.

66
06:58.623 --> 07:00.040
It's better for your brother's stability

67
07:00.040 --> 07:03.206
and the continuity of my work.

68
07:03.206 --> 07:05.581
I just want to see if he's okay.

69
07:05.581 --> 07:07.790
I didn't mean to disturb your work.

70
07:07.790 --> 07:09.415
I understand.

71
07:09.415 --> 07:12.623
Actually, I have something to show you.

72
07:20.540 --> 07:22.040
Using your blood sample

73
07:22.040 --> 07:23.415
combined with previous cultures,

74
07:23.415 --> 07:26.248
I've synthesized a preliminary test fluid.

75
07:26.248 --> 07:29.792
Theoretically, it can enhance the affinity to specific viral proteins.

76
07:29.792 --> 07:31.706
Want to see the initial results?

77
07:31.706 --> 07:35.123
Though, it's only in the testing phase.

78
07:35.915 --> 07:37.750
Okay.

79
07:37.750 --> 07:39.477
Follow me.

80
07:45.083 --> 07:47.046
Help me lift this cloth.

81
08:55.253 --> 08:56.291
Brother.

82
08:56.291 --> 08:57.331
Brother.

83
08:57.331 --> 08:59.165
Brother, can you hear me?

84
08:59.165 --> 09:01.139
It's Lin Zai, Brother.

85
09:02.123 --> 09:04.498
- Brother. - Don't be too anxious.

86
09:04.498 --> 09:07.292
The test fluid reacted with the virus.

87
09:07.292 --> 09:10.000
It significantly suppressed the abnormal discharge of motor neurons.

88
09:10.000 --> 09:13.081
So, his manic state has lessened.

89
09:13.081 --> 09:16.083
But the infection signal in the core nervous system

90
09:16.083 --> 09:17.651
has barely decreased at all.

91
09:17.651 --> 09:22.331
This test fluid is still far from being able to wake him up.

92
09:24.123 --> 09:27.165
But at least it proves we're on the right track.

93
09:27.165 --> 09:29.081
However, the dosage, the purity...

94
09:29.081 --> 09:32.790
Or rather, we haven't found the key that can penetrate the blood-brain barrier

95
09:32.790 --> 09:35.748
and precisely neutralize the core virus.

96
09:35.748 --> 09:37.331
It still needs more adjustments.

97
09:37.331 --> 09:39.040
More tests.

98
09:39.040 --> 09:43.623
And more of your blood for analysis and optimization.

99
09:44.790 --> 09:46.570
I understand.

100
09:47.706 --> 09:50.456
As long as I can save my brother,

101
09:50.456 --> 09:52.456
no matter how long it takes,

102
09:52.456 --> 09:54.540
how much time is needed,

103
09:54.540 --> 09:56.250
or what you need me to do,

104
09:56.250 --> 09:57.990
I'll cooperate.

105
10:00.333 --> 10:03.750
He Yao, continue with the experiment.

106
10:03.750 --> 10:05.770
I'll be fine.

107
10:06.730 --> 10:08.989
Good. Remember what you said.

108
10:08.989 --> 10:11.875
And remember, maintaining your own stability

109
10:11.875 --> 10:14.481
is the key to continuing the experiment.

110
10:36.790 --> 10:39.165
Where's that boy, Lie?

111
10:39.165 --> 10:42.123
Why didn't he come for dinner?

112
10:43.375 --> 10:47.050
Are you two all right?

113
10:49.958 --> 10:53.038
He looked quite upset today.

114
10:54.082 --> 10:56.039
He's fine, Grandma.

115
10:56.039 --> 10:59.528
He... probably just wants to be alone.

116
11:18.292 --> 11:20.456
Chen, please look after Grandma.

117
11:20.456 --> 11:21.498
I'll go check on him.

118
11:21.498 --> 11:23.047
Sure. Go ahead.

119
11:59.956 --> 12:01.581
Lin Zai.

120
12:03.125 --> 12:04.575
Lin Zai.

121
12:22.250 --> 12:23.915
It's lights out.

122
12:23.915 --> 12:26.165
Please return to your rooms.

123
12:26.165 --> 12:27.456
Lock your doors and windows.

124
12:27.456 --> 12:29.244
Stay safe.

125
12:30.040 --> 12:31.581
It's lights out.

126
12:31.581 --> 12:33.831
Please return to your rooms.

127
12:33.831 --> 12:35.123
Lock your doors and windows.

128
12:35.123 --> 12:37.123
Stay safe.

129
12:37.956 --> 12:39.456
It's lights out.

130
12:39.456 --> 12:41.748
Please return to your rooms.

131
12:41.748 --> 12:42.956
Lock your doors and windows.

132
12:42.956 --> 12:44.965
Stay safe.

133
12:44.965 --> 12:46.738
It's lights out.

134
12:46.738 --> 12:48.856
Please return to your rooms.

135
12:48.856 --> 12:50.250
Lock your doors and windows.

136
12:50.250 --> 12:52.226
Stay safe.

137
13:16.500 --> 13:18.625
Lin Zai.

138
13:18.625 --> 13:19.667
It's time to go inside.

139
13:19.667 --> 13:22.183
The patrol will be doing a headcount soon.

140
13:23.623 --> 13:26.135
Yeah, I know.

141
13:27.625 --> 13:29.510
Are you okay?

142
13:47.748 --> 13:50.128
Lin Zai, are you okay?

143
13:51.915 --> 13:54.167
I'm fine, Chen.

144
13:54.167 --> 13:55.576
I'm just a little tired.

145
13:55.576 --> 13:57.602
I wanted to get some fresh air.

146
13:59.623 --> 14:01.248
If you're tired, get some rest.

147
14:01.248 --> 14:03.550
Don't push yourself too hard.

148
14:04.406 --> 14:07.959
If you're willing to talk, I'm here to listen.

149
14:12.417 --> 14:14.748
You know...

150
14:14.748 --> 14:17.098
I said some very harsh things to Lie.

151
14:19.167 --> 14:21.618
I said he doesn't understand feelings.

152
14:23.581 --> 14:25.792
And...

153
14:25.792 --> 14:28.300
And many other hurtful things.

154
14:34.708 --> 14:36.764
But I had no choice.

155
14:38.456 --> 14:41.623
I know there's a huge difference between us.

156
14:42.956 --> 14:47.500
If we continue, nothing good will come of it.

157
14:47.500 --> 14:49.532
I should be decisive.

158
14:49.532 --> 14:51.045
Right?

159
14:53.623 --> 14:56.040
But I still can't let go.

160
14:59.498 --> 15:01.373
I can't let go.

161
15:02.790 --> 15:05.415
But what can I do if I can't let go?

162
15:06.833 --> 15:09.543
I have reasons why I must do this.

163
15:39.792 --> 15:42.020
Do you feel any discomfort?

164
16:07.373 --> 16:09.165
Press down on this for five minutes.

165
16:09.165 --> 16:12.088
I drew a bit more blood than usual.

166
16:16.748 --> 16:17.790
Drink this.

167
16:17.790 --> 16:21.123
It's an iron supplement and good for your recovery.

168
16:22.581 --> 16:24.373
Go back and rest early today.

169
16:24.373 --> 16:26.123
If you feel dizzy or have palpitations,

170
16:26.123 --> 16:28.068
lie down immediately.

171
16:41.123 --> 16:43.540
If you need anything, come find me anytime.

172
16:43.540 --> 16:44.912
Okay.

173
16:59.708 --> 17:01.205
Wait.

174
17:01.205 --> 17:02.414
No rush.

175
17:02.414 --> 17:04.061
Sit for a while longer.

176
17:07.375 --> 17:09.523
How is your research going?

177
17:11.956 --> 17:14.883
Lin Zai, experiments take time.

178
17:14.883 --> 17:17.570
Your brother will get better day by day.

179
17:18.956 --> 17:20.415
Then I'll come back tomorrow.

180
17:20.415 --> 17:21.915
Is that okay?

181
17:21.915 --> 17:23.998
I want to see him get better soon.

182
17:23.998 --> 17:26.123
The sooner, the better.

183
17:26.956 --> 17:28.123
Okay.

184
17:28.123 --> 17:29.290
But you have to promise me,

185
17:29.290 --> 17:30.415
take good care of yourself.

186
17:30.415 --> 17:32.290
Go back and eat more today.

187
17:32.290 --> 17:35.165
- Get some rest early. - Okay.

188
17:35.165 --> 17:36.790
Hey.

189
17:36.790 --> 17:38.415
Do you need me to walk you back?

190
17:38.415 --> 17:39.706
In your current state,

191
17:39.706 --> 17:41.623
I'm worried about you being alone.

192
17:41.623 --> 17:44.001
It's okay. I'll be fine on my own.

193
18:30.101 --> 18:36.176
[Lin Zai 002]
